{{also|Sharpness}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|sharp|ness}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es|-}}

# {{uncountable}} the [[cutting]] [[ability]] of an [[edge]]; [[keenness]]
# {{uncountable}} the fineness of the point a pointed object
# {{countable}} The product or result of being [[sharp]].
# {{context|of food etc}} [[pungency]] or [[acidity]]
# {{context|of an image}} [[distinctness]], [[focus]]
# {{context|of intelligence}} [[acuteness]] or [[acuity]]

